.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/notifications{?since,all,participating}","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/labels{/name}","releases_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/releases{/id}","deployments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/deployments","created_at":"2020-01-18T21:13:55Z","updated_at":"2025-12-12T22:52:09Z","pushed_at":"2025-12-12T23:49:54Z","git_url":"git://github.com/bevyengine/bevy.git","ssh_url":"git@github.com:bevyengine/bevy.git","clone_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy.git","svn_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy","homepage":"https://bevy.org","size":153505,"stargazers_count":43454,"watchers_count":43454,"language":"Rust","has_issues":true,"has_projects":true,"has_downloads":true,"has_wiki":false,"has_pages":true,"has_discussions":true,"forks_count":4270,"mirror_url":null,"archived":false,"disabled":false,"open_issues_count":3179,"license":{"key":"apache-2.0","name":"Apache License 2.0","spdx_id":"Apache-2.0","url":"https://api.github.com/licenses/apache-2.0","node_id":"MDc6TGljZW5zZTI="},"allow_forking":true,"is_template":false,"web_commit_signoff_required":false,"topics":["bevy","game-development","game-engine","gamedev","open-source","rust"],"visibility":"public","forks":4270,"open_issues":3179,"watchers":43454,"default_branch":"main","permissions":{"admin":false,"maintain":false,"push":false,"triage":false,"pull":true}},"body":"I'm on Windows. I load a wav file in the setup and store it in my state:\r\n```\r\nstate.bug_sound = asset_server\r\n            .load(\"assets/sfx_sounds_powerup6.wav\")\r\n            .unwrap();\r\n```\r\nI then play it inside my system:\r\n```\r\nfn my_system(... mut state: ResMut<State>, audio_output: Res<AudioOutput>,...){\r\n...\r\naudio_output.play(state.bug_sound);\r\n}\r\n```\r\nGives me a nasty panic:\r\n```\r\n 68:     0x7ff78d24d762 - core::option::expect_failed\r\n                               at /rustc/043f6d747c15068f0053a0542e9b0f17ae7f4de4\\/library\\core\\src\\option.rs:1213\r\n  69:     0x7ff78d3a08c1 - core::option::Option<alloc::vec::Vec<tuple<>>>::expect<alloc::vec::Vec<tuple<>>>\r\n                               at C:\\Users\\JP\\.rustup\\toolchains\\nightly-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\\lib\\rustlib\\src\\rust\\library\\core\\src\\option.rs:333\r\n  70:     0x7ff78d1f49bd - async_task::task::{{impl}}::poll<alloc::vec::Vec<tuple<>>>\r\n                               at C:\\Users\\JP\\.cargo\\registry\\src\\github.com-1ecc6299db9ec823\\async-task-4.0.2\\src\\task.rs:368\r\n  71:     0x7ff78d39e2d9 - futures_lite::future::block_on::{{closure}}<alloc::vec::Vec<tuple<>>,async_task::task::Task<alloc::vec::Vec<tuple<>>>>\r\n                               at C:\\Users\\JP\\.cargo\\registry\\src\\github.com-1ecc6299db9ec823\\futures-lite-1.8.0\\src\\future.rs:89\r\n  72:     0x7ff78d201e54 - std::thread::local::LocalKey<core::cell::RefCell<tuple<parking::Parker, core::task::wake::Waker>>>::try_with<core::cell::RefCell<tuple<parking::Parker, core::task::wake::Waker>>,closure-0,alloc::vec::Vec<tuple<>>>\r\n                               at C:\\Users\\JP\\.rustup\\toolchains\\nightly-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\\lib\\rustlib\\src\\rust\\library\\std\\src\\thread\\local.rs:272\r\n  73:     0x7ff78d201c58 - std::thread::local::LocalKey<core::cell::RefCell<tuple<parking::Parker, core::task::wake::Waker>>>::with<core::cell::RefCell<tuple<parking::Parker, core::task::wake::Waker>>,closure-0,alloc::vec::Vec<tuple<>>>\r\n                               at C:\\Users\\JP\\.rustup\\toolchains\\nightly-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc\\lib\\rustlib\\src\\rust\\library\\std\\src\\thread\\local.rs:248\r\n  74:     0x7ff78d39e18d - futures_lite::future::block_on<alloc::vec::Vec<tuple<>>,async_task::task::Task<alloc::vec::Vec<tuple<>>>>\r\n                               at C:\\Users\\JP\\.cargo\\registry\\src\\github.com-1ecc6299db9ec823\\futures-lite-1.8.0\\src\\future.rs:79\r\n  75:     0x7ff78d2011e5 - bevy_tasks::task_pool::TaskPool::scope<closure-0,tuple<>>\r\n                               at C:\\Users\\JP\\.cargo\\registry\\src\\github.com-1ecc6299db9ec823\\bevy_tasks-0.2.1\\src\\task_pool.rs:198\r\n  76:     0x7ff78d6ff2b5 - bevy_ecs::schedule::parallel_executor::ExecutorStage::run_systems\r\n```\r\n\r\nAny idea? Have I missed a step somewhere?","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/590/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/590/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}},"event":"cross-referenced"},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/753390247","html_url":"https://github.com/bevyengine/bevy/issues/640#issuecomment-753390247","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/640","id":753390247,"node_id":"MDEyOklzc3VlQ29tbWVudDc1MzM5MDI0Nw==","user":{"login":"cart","id":2694663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTQ2NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2694663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart","html_url":"https://github.com/cart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2021-01-01T21:58:00Z","updated_at":"2021-01-01T21:59:15Z","body":"Loading happens asynchronously in a non-blocking manner.  We can't provide / handle load errors at the point where load is called because the load hasn't happened yet.\r\n\r\n`audio_output.play()` is also asynchronous. It will play the audio as soon as it has loaded.\r\n\r\n```rust\r\n// this just kicks off the load process\r\nlet music = asset_server\r\n    .load(\"WindlessSlopes.ogg\");\r\n   // .unwrap() ----> The latest Bevy no longer unwraps here\r\n\r\n// doesn't immediately panic. it panics (in a separate thread without crashing) in the latest Bevy\r\naudio_output.play(music);\r\n```\r\n\r\nThat being said, we should provide a way for users to respond to asset load errors. This should probably happen by adding downcastable errors to an event queue. \r\n\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/bevyengine/bevy/issues/comments/753390247/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"cart","id":2694663,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2OTQ2NjM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2694663?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart","html_url":"https://github.com/cart","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cart/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false}},{"actor":{"login":"MinerSebas","id":66798382,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2Nzk4Mzgy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubuser